{
  "width": 720,
  "height": 720,
  "format": "png",
  "name": "Bluebeard",
  "captionFontSize": 14,
  "defaultTransitionDuration": 2000,
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM001",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM001.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "There was once a very wealthy gentleman whose name was Bluebeard.",
      "description": "[A wealthy man with strange blue beard]",
      "scene": "A wealthy man with strange blue beard"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM002",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM002.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "He desired to marry one of the daughters of a neighboring lady of quality.",
      "description": "[Two beautiful young women]",
      "scene": "Two beautiful young women"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM003",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM003.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "They would neither of them have him, for he had already been married to several wives, and nobody ever knew what became of them.",
      "description": "[Women pointing and turning away]",
      "scene": "Women pointing and turning away"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM004",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM004.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Bluebeard took them to one of his country seats, where they stayed a whole week.",
      "description": "[Carriages and dancers at a country estate]",
      "scene": "Carriages and dancers at a country estate"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM005",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM005.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "There was nothing then to be seen but parties of pleasure, hunting, fishing, dancing, mirth, and feasting.",
      "description": "[Merry feasting and dancing]",
      "scene": "Merry feasting and dancing"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM006",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM006.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "The youngest daughter began to think the master of the house not to have a beard so very blue, and that he was a mighty civil gentleman.",
      "description": "[Young woman smiling at bearded man]",
      "scene": "Young woman smiling at bearded man"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM007",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM007.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "As soon as they returned home, the marriage was concluded.",
      "description": "[New bride in elegant room]",
      "scene": "New bride in elegant room"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM008",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM008.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Here are the keys of the two great wardrobes, wherein I have my best furniture.",
      "description": "[Bluebeard handing keys to wife]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard handing keys to wife"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM009",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM009.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Open them all, go into all and every one of them, except that little closet, which I forbid you.",
      "description": "[Wife listening with concern]",
      "scene": "Wife listening with concern"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM010",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM010.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "He, after having embraced her, got into his coach and proceeded on his journey.",
      "description": "[Bluebeard departing by coach]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard departing by coach"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM011",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM011.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Her neighbors and good friends ran through all the rooms, closets, and wardrobes, which were all so fine and rich.",
      "description": "[Excited friends examining rooms]",
      "scene": "Excited friends examining rooms"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM012",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM012.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "They could not sufficiently admire the number and beauty of the tapestry, beds, couches, cabinets, stands, tables, and looking-glasses.",
      "description": "[Admiring mirrors and tapestries]",
      "scene": "Admiring mirrors and tapestries"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM013",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM013.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "She was so much pressed by her curiosity that she went down a little back staircase with excessive haste.",
      "description": "[Wife looking down staircase]",
      "scene": "Wife looking down staircase"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM014",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM014.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "She took the little key and opened it, trembling.",
      "description": "[Hands trembling at forbidden door]",
      "scene": "Hands trembling at forbidden door"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM015",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM015.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "She perceived that the floor was all covered over with clotted blood, on which lay the bodies of several dead women ranged against the walls.",
      "description": "[Horror of blood and bodies]",
      "scene": "Horror of blood and bodies"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM016",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM016.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "She thought she should have died for fear, and the key fell out of her hand.",
      "description": "[Wife collapsing in fear]",
      "scene": "Wife collapsing in fear"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM017",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM017.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "She tried two or three times to wipe it off, but the blood would not come out.",
      "description": "[Trying to clean bloody key]",
      "scene": "Trying to clean bloody key"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM018",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM018.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "The key was magical and she could never make it quite clean.",
      "description": "[Bloodstained key in hand]",
      "scene": "Bloodstained key in hand"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM019",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM019.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Bluebeard returned from his journey the same evening.",
      "description": "[Bluebeard returning by coach]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard returning by coach"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM020",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM020.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Next morning he asked her for the keys, which she gave him with trembling hands.",
      "description": "[Wife handing keys with trembling hands]",
      "scene": "Wife handing keys with trembling hands"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM021",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM021.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "How comes this blood upon the key?",
      "description": "[Man examining bloodstained key]",
      "scene": "Man examining bloodstained key"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM022",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM022.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "I do not know, cried the poor woman, paler than death.",
      "description": "[Woman pale as death]",
      "scene": "Woman pale as death"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM023",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM023.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "You were resolved to go into the closet, were you not?",
      "description": "[Bluebeard pointing angrily]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard pointing angrily"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM024",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM024.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Upon this she threw herself at her husband's feet and begged his pardon with all the signs of true repentance.",
      "description": "[Wife at husband's feet]",
      "scene": "Wife at husband's feet"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM025",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM025.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "You must die, madam, and that presently.",
      "description": "[Bluebeard with hard expression]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard with hard expression"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM026",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM026.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Since I must die, give me some little time to say my prayers.",
      "description": "[Wife weeping]",
      "scene": "Wife weeping"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM027",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM027.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Sister Anne, go up, I beg you, upon the top of the tower, and look if my brothers are not coming.",
      "description": "[Woman calling up to tower]",
      "scene": "Woman calling up to tower"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM028",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM028.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Anne, sister Anne, do you see anyone coming?",
      "description": "[Wife calling from window]",
      "scene": "Wife calling from window"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM029",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM029.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "I see nothing but the sun, which makes a dust, and the grass, which looks green.",
      "description": "[Sister on tower top]",
      "scene": "Sister on tower top"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM030",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM030.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Come down instantly, or I shall come up to you.",
      "description": "[Bluebeard with raised sword]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard with raised sword"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM031",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM031.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "One moment longer, if you please.",
      "description": "[Wife desperate at window]",
      "scene": "Wife desperate at window"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM032",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM032.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "I see a great dust, which comes on this side here.",
      "description": "[Sister looking into distance]",
      "scene": "Sister looking into distance"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM033",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM033.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Alas, no, my dear sister, I see a flock of sheep.",
      "description": "[Sheep in the field]",
      "scene": "Sheep in the field"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM034",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM034.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Anne, sister Anne, dost thou not see anyone coming?",
      "description": "[Wife crying out]",
      "scene": "Wife crying out"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM035",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM035.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "I see two horsemen, but they are yet a great way off.",
      "description": "[Two distant riders]",
      "scene": "Two distant riders"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM036",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM036.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "God be praised, they are my brothers.",
      "description": "[Wife with hope in her eyes]",
      "scene": "Wife with hope in her eyes"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM037",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM037.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Then Bluebeard bawled out so loud that he made the whole house tremble.",
      "description": "[Bluebeard furious, house trembling]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard furious, house trembling"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM038",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM038.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "The distressed wife came down and threw herself at his feet, all in tears, with her hair about her shoulders.",
      "description": "[Wife on floor with hair disheveled]",
      "scene": "Wife on floor with hair disheveled"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM039",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM039.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "This signifies nothing, says Bluebeard, you must die.",
      "description": "[Sword raised above kneeling woman]",
      "scene": "Sword raised above kneeling woman"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM040",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM040.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "At this very instant there was such a loud knocking at the gate.",
      "description": "[Gate bursting open, riders charging]",
      "scene": "Gate bursting open, riders charging"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM041",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM041.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "Two horsemen entered who, drawing their swords, ran directly to Bluebeard.",
      "description": "[Two brothers with swords drawn]",
      "scene": "Two brothers with swords drawn"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM042",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM042.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "He ran away immediately to save himself.",
      "description": "[Bluebeard fleeing in terror]",
      "scene": "Bluebeard fleeing in terror"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM043",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM043.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "They overtook him and ran their swords through his body and left him dead.",
      "description": "[Swords piercing Bluebeard]",
      "scene": "Swords piercing Bluebeard"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM044",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM044.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "The poor wife was almost as dead as her husband, and had not strength enough to rise.",
      "description": "[Wife barely conscious]",
      "scene": "Wife barely conscious"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM045",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM045.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "She made use of one part of it to marry her sister Anne to a young gentleman who had loved her a long while.",
      "description": "[Bride in white at new wedding]",
      "scene": "Bride in white at new wedding"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bluebeard_MM046",
      "filename": "Bluebeard_MM046.json",
      "interpOrder": false,
      "caption": "And the rest to marry herself to a very worthy gentleman, who made her forget the ill time she had passed with Bluebeard.",
      "description": "[Wife in fine dress with new husband]",
      "scene": "Wife in fine dress with new husband"
    }
  ]
}